# Local scratch configs: exported VMs and batch files written while working,
# which live at the repo root. Scoped to the root on purpose -- a blanket
# *.yaml/*.yml ignore also swallowed tests/fixtures and .github/workflows, which
# is why this project had no CI (H-01).
/*.yaml
/*.yml
!/pyproject.toml

# Sphinx build output; regenerate with `make html` (H-02).
docs/sphinx/_build/
docs/sphinx-ar/_build/

